flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> Landing[Landing Page]

    %% ── Chat Widget - available site-wide ──
    Landing -->|Chat bubble button| ChatOpen[Open Chat with Staff]
    ChatOpen --> ChatMsg[Send and Receive Chat Messages]
    ChatMsg --> ChatClose[Close Chat]
    ChatClose -->|Return to page| Landing

    %% ── Landing to Auth ──
    Landing --> LoginPg[Login Page]
    Landing --> RegPg[Registration Page]
    LoginPg -->|Create an account| RegPg

    %% ════════════════════════════════
    subgraph AUTH [Authentication]

        %% Registration
        RegPg --> EnterReg[Enter Name, Email and Password]
        EnterReg --> EmailTaken{Email Already Taken?}
        EmailTaken -->|Yes| RegErr[Show Error: Email Taken]
        RegErr -->|Return to Registration| RegPg
        EmailTaken -->|No| EncryptPw[Encrypt Password]
        EncryptPw --> CreateAcct[Create Customer Account]
        CreateAcct --> CreateSession

        %% Forgot Password
        LoginPg -->|Forgot password?| FpStart[Request Password Reset]
        FpStart --> FpEmail[Enter Registered Email]
        FpEmail --> FpFound{Email Registered?}
        FpFound -->|No| FpGeneric[Show Generic Confirmation]
        FpGeneric -->|Return to Login| LoginPg
        FpFound -->|Yes| StoreCode[Store Reset Code Securely]
        StoreCode --> SendResetCode[Send Reset Code by Email]
        SendResetCode --> EnterResetCode[Enter Reset Code]
        EnterResetCode --> ResetValid{Reset Code Valid and Not Expired?}
        ResetValid -->|Invalid| ResetInvalid[Show Error: Invalid Code]
        ResetInvalid -->|Return to Login| LoginPg
        ResetValid -->|Valid| SetNewPw[Set New Password]
        SetNewPw -->|Login with new password| CreateSession

        %% Lockout Check
        LoginPg --> AcctLocked{Account Locked?}
        AcctLocked -->|Yes| LockMsg[Show Lockout Message with Time Remaining]
        LockMsg -->|Return to Login| LoginPg
        AcctLocked -->|No| LoginMethod{Login Method?}

        %% Email + Password path
        LoginMethod -->|Email + Password| EnterEP[Enter Email and Password]
        EnterEP --> ValidateCred[Validate Credentials]
        ValidateCred --> CredValid{Credentials Valid?}
        CredValid -->|Invalid| IncrAttempts[Increment Failed Attempts Counter]
        IncrAttempts --> FiveCheck{5 Failed Attempts?}
        FiveCheck -->|Yes| LockAcct[Lock Account for 5 Minutes]
        LockAcct --> LogSecEv[Log Security Event]
        LogSecEv -->|Return to Login| LoginPg
        FiveCheck -->|No| ShowRemaining[Show Error and Remaining Attempts]
        ShowRemaining -->|Return to Login| LoginPg
        CredValid -->|Valid| TwoFACheck{2FA Enabled?}
        TwoFACheck -->|Yes| EnterTOTP[Enter Authentication Code]
        EnterTOTP --> TOTPValid{Code Valid?}
        TOTPValid -->|Invalid| TOTPInvalid[Show Error: Invalid Code]
        TOTPInvalid -->|Return to Login| LoginPg
        TOTPValid -->|Valid| CreateSession[Create Login Session]
        TwoFACheck -->|No| CreateSession

        %% Google OAuth path
        LoginMethod -->|Google Account| GoogleAuth[Authenticate via Google Account]
        GoogleAuth --> GoogleReceive[Receive Google Account Details]
        GoogleReceive --> GoogleMatch[Create or Match Account]
        GoogleMatch --> CreateSession

        CreateSession --> RecordSession[Record Login Session]
        RecordSession --> CheckRole{Check User Role?}

    end
    %% ════════════════════════════════

    %% ════════════════════════════════
    subgraph CUST [Customer Account]

        CheckRole -->|Customer| MyAccount[My Account Page]

        MyAccount -->|View orders| ViewOrders[View My Orders]
        ViewOrders --> OrderStatus[View Order Status]
        OrderStatus --> DeliveryQ{Out for Delivery?}
        DeliveryQ -->|Yes| GetRoute[Retrieve Delivery Route]
        GetRoute --> MapSvc[Get Route from Map Service]
        MapSvc --> RecIntegMap[Record Integration Event]
        RecIntegMap --> ShowMap[Show Map, ETA and Distance]
        ShowMap -->|Return to Order Status| OrderStatus
        DeliveryQ -->|Completed| FeedbackNode[Submit Feedback]
        FeedbackNode -->|Return to My Account| MyAccount
        OrderStatus -->|Star order| SaveOrder[Save Order to Favourites]
        SaveOrder -->|Return to Order Status| OrderStatus

        MyAccount -->|Notifications| ViewNotifs[View Notifications]
        ViewNotifs --> MarkRead[Mark Notification as Read]
        MarkRead -->|Return to My Account| MyAccount

        MyAccount -->|Edit profile| UpdateProfile[Update Profile Information]
        UpdateProfile -->|Return to My Account| MyAccount

        MyAccount -->|Change password| ChangePw[Change Password]
        ChangePw -->|Return to My Account| MyAccount

        MyAccount -->|Manage 2FA| Setup2FA[Setup Two-Factor Authentication]
        Setup2FA --> GenQR[Generate QR Code for Authenticator App]
        GenQR -->|Return to My Account| MyAccount

        MyAccount -->|Contact Us| ContactUs[Send Contact Message]
        ContactUs -->|Return to My Account| MyAccount

    end
    %% ════════════════════════════════

    %% ════════════════════════════════
    subgraph BOOKING [Booking]

        MyAccount -->|Browse packages| PkgPage[Packages Page]
        PkgPage --> SelectPkg[Select Packages]
        SelectPkg --> HoldPkg[Hold Selected Packages]
        HoldPkg --> Step1[Booking Step 1: Enter Pickup Details]
        Step1 -->|Check weather for pickup date| WeatherChk[Check Weather Forecast]
        WeatherChk --> RecIntegWx[Record Integration Event]
        RecIntegWx --> WeatherWarn[Show Weather Warning]
        WeatherWarn -->|Proceed| Step2
        Step1 --> Step2[Booking Step 2: Select Payment Method]
        Step2 --> PayMethod{Payment Method?}
        PayMethod -->|Online| OnlinePay[Confirm Online Payment]
        OnlinePay -->|Cancelled| PayCancel[Payment Cancelled]
        PayCancel -->|Return to Payment Step| Step2
        OnlinePay -->|Confirmed| PayDone[Mark Payment as Paid]
        PayDone --> Step3
        PayMethod -->|Cash on Pickup| Step3[Booking Step 3: Review Order Summary]
        Step3 --> FieldsValid{All Fields Valid?}
        FieldsValid -->|No| ValErr[Show Validation Errors]
        ValErr -->|Correct and retry| Step3
        FieldsValid -->|Yes| Step4[Booking Step 4: Confirm and Submit]
        Step4 --> SaveOrderRec[Save Order Record and Record Payment]
        SaveOrderRec --> SendSMS[Send SMS Confirmation]
        SendSMS --> RecIntegSMS[Record Integration Event]
        SendSMS --> BkConfirm[Booking Confirmed]
        BkConfirm -->|Return to My Account| MyAccount

    end
    %% ════════════════════════════════

    %% ════════════════════════════════
    subgraph ADMIN [Admin Operations]

        CheckRole -->|Staff / SuperAdmin| AdminDash[Admin Dashboard]

        AdminDash -->|Orders tab| MgrOrders[View and Manage Orders]
        MgrOrders --> UpdateStatus[Update Order Status]
        UpdateStatus --> StatusPipeline["Order Pipeline: Received > Washing > Drying > Ready for Delivery > Out for Delivery > Completed / Cancelled"]
        StatusPipeline --> AssignRider[Assign Rider to Order]
        AssignRider --> SendStatusNotif[Send Status Update Notification to Customer]
        SendStatusNotif --> RecAdminA[Record Admin Action]

        AdminDash -->|Customers tab| MgrCust[Manage Customers: View, Edit or Ban]
        MgrCust --> RecAdminA

        AdminDash -->|Staff tab - SuperAdmin| MgrStaff[Manage Staff: Add, Edit or Deactivate]
        MgrStaff --> RecAdminA

        AdminDash -->|Riders tab| MgrRiders[Manage Riders: Add, Edit or Remove]
        MgrRiders --> RecAdminA

        AdminDash -->|Packages tab| MgrPkgs[Manage Packages: Add, Edit or Remove]
        MgrPkgs --> RecAdminA

        AdminDash -->|Promotions tab| MgrPromos[Manage Promotions: Add, Edit or Remove]
        MgrPromos --> RecAdminA

        AdminDash -->|Settings tab - SuperAdmin| MaintMode[Toggle Maintenance Mode]
        MaintMode --> RecAdminA

        RecAdminA -->|Return to Dashboard| AdminDash

        AdminDash -->|Analytics tab| Analytics[View Analytics and Statistics]
        Analytics -->|Return to Dashboard| AdminDash

        AdminDash -->|Audit tab| AuditLog[View Audit Log]
        AuditLog -->|Return to Dashboard| AdminDash

        AdminDash -->|Security tab| SecEvents[View Security Events]
        SecEvents -->|Return to Dashboard| AdminDash

        AdminDash -->|Customer Chat tab| CustChat[View Customer Chat Rooms]
        CustChat --> CustChatReply[Read and Reply to Customer Messages]
        CustChatReply -->|Return to Dashboard| AdminDash

        AdminDash -->|Staff Chat tab| StaffChat[Staff Chat - Internal]
        StaffChat --> StaffChatMsg[Send and Receive Staff Messages]
        StaffChatMsg -->|Return to Dashboard| AdminDash

        AdminDash -->|Notifications tab| AdminNotifs[View Notifications]
        AdminNotifs --> AdminNotifRead[Mark Notification as Read]
        AdminNotifRead -->|Return to Dashboard| AdminDash

    end
    %% ════════════════════════════════

    MyAccount --> END_CUST([END - Customer Session])
    AdminDash -->|Logout| END_ADMIN([END - Admin Session])
